{title: Steadfast Love and Faithfulness}
{subtitle: Psalms 85:10–11}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 73}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] [F/A] | [Gm] [Bb/D] | [Eb] [Bb/D] | [Fsus4] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Grace and [F/A]truth have [Gm7]finally [Eb]met
Right[Bb/D]eousness [Fsus4]and peace have kissed
Sal[Bb]vation is [F/A]close for the [Gm7]ones who [Bb/D]fear
[Eb]Glory is [Bb/D]dwelling right [Fsus4]here
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Steadfast [F/A]love and faith[Gm7]fulness [Bb/D]met
[Eb]Right[Bb/D]eousness [Fsus4]and peace have kissed
[Bb]Faithfulness [F/A]springs up from [Gm7]the [Bb/D]ground
[Eb]Righteousness looks [Fsus4]down from on [Bb]high
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The Lord him[F/A]self will [Gm7]give what is [Bb/D]good
[Eb]Our land will [Bb/D]yield its [Fsus4]increase
[Bb]Righteousness [F/A]goes be[Gm7]fore him [Bb/D]
[Eb]Making a path [Bb/D]for his [Fsus4]steps
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Steadfast [F/A]love and faith[Gm7]fulness [Bb/D]met
[Eb]Righteous[Bb/D]ness and [Fsus4]peace have kissed
[Bb]Faithfulness [F/A]springs up from [Gm7]the [Bb/D]ground
[Eb]Righteousness looks [Fsus4]down from on [Bb]high
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Gm7] [F/A] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Fsus4] |

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Steadfast [F/A]love and faith[Gm7]fulness [Bb/D]met
[Eb]Righteous[Bb/D]ness and [Fsus4]peace have kissed
[F]Faith[Bb]fulness springs [F/A]up from the [Gm7][Bb/D]ground
